flowchart LR
    Plant[Plant Sensors/Cameras] --> Sim[Simulator / Ingest]
    Sim --> EB[Event Bus]
    EB --> WS[(World State)]
    WS --> TL[Timeline Event Store]
    TL --> HG[(Hazard Graph)]
    HG --> Chronos[Chronos Engine]
    Chronos --> Risk[Risk Engine]
    Risk --> Plan[Planner]
    Plan --> MC[Mission Control]